<!ELEMENT author (#PCDATA)>
<!ELEMENT genre (#PCDATA)>
<!ELEMENT price (#PCDATA)>
<!ATTLIST book id ID #REQUIRED availability status (in-stock | out-of-stock)>
<!ATTLIST price currency CDATA #FIXED "MUR">
